an>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#4C4F69;--shiki-dark:#CAD3F5\">%\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8839EF;--shiki-dark:#C6A0F6\">else\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#7C7F93;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#939AB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    ; código para Linux x86-64\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#4C4F69;--shiki-dark:#CAD3F5\">%\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8839EF;--shiki-dark:#C6A0F6\">endif\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>La macro \u003Ccode>WIN64\u003C/code> se define automáticamente por CMakeLists.txt\ncuando se compila en Windows.\u003C/p>",{"headings":23,"localImagePaths":61,"remoteImagePaths":62,"frontmatter":63,"imagePaths":65},[24,27,30,34,37,40,43,46,49,52,55,58],{"depth":25,"slug":26,"text":14},1,"guía-de-sintaxis-nasm-x86-64",{"depth":28,"slug":29,"text":15},2,"convenciones-de-llamada",{"depth":31,"slug":32,"text":33},3,"system-v-amd64-abi-linux-macos","System V AMD64 ABI (Linux, macOS)",{"depth":31,"slug":35,"text":36},"microsoft-x64-abi-windows","Microsoft x64 ABI (Windows)",{"depth":28,"slug":38,"text":39},"sintaxis-nasm-intel","Sintaxis NASM (Intel)",{"depth":31,"slug":41,"text":42},"secciones","Secciones",{"depth":31,"slug":44,"text":45},"definir-datos","Definir datos",{"depth":31,"slug":47,"text":48},"saltos-condicionales","Saltos condicionales",{"depth":31,"slug":50,"text":51},"directivas-útiles","Directivas útiles",{"depth":31,"slug":53,"text":54},"llamar-funciones-c-desde-asm","Llamar funciones C desde ASM",{"depth":31,"slug":56,"text":57},"syscalls-linux-x86-64","Syscalls Linux x86-64",{"depth":31,"slug":59,"text":60},"compilación-condicional-con-nasm","Compilación condicional con NASM",[],[],{"title":14,"description":15,"pubDate":64,"slug":11},["Date","2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[],"asm.md","examples",{"id":67,"data":69,"body":73,"filePath":74,"digest":75,"rendered":76,"legacyId":92},{"title":70,"description":71,"pubDate":72},"Ejemplos","Hola Mundo en ensamblador",["Date","2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z"],"# Ejemplos\n\n## Hola Mundo en ensamblador\n\n`hello_asm` imprime \"Hello, World!\" llamando a `printf` desde\nensamblador, demostrando la integración C + ASM y la convención\nde llamada según la plataforma.\n\n```nasm\nhello_asm:\n    sub rsp, 40         ; shadow space (Win64) / alignment\n\n%ifdef WIN64\n    lea rcx, [rel msg]  ; 1er arg en rcx (Win64)\n%else\n    lea rdi, [rel msg]  ; 1er arg en rdi (System V)\n    xor eax, eax        ; variadic: 0 registros XMM\n%endif\n\n    call printf\n    add rsp, 40\n    ret\n```\n\nLlamada desde C:\n\n```c\n#include \"lib/examples/hello.h\"\n\nhello_asm();  // imprime \"Hello, World!\"\n```\n\n## Fibonacci\n\n`fibo_asm(n)` calcula el n-ésimo número de Fibonacci de forma\niterativa usando solo registros. Sigue la misma lógica sin\nimportar la plataforma; solo cambia cómo se obtiene el argumento.\n\n| Parámetro | Linux (System V) | Windows (MS x64) |\n|-----------|-----------------|-------------------|\n| `n` (1er arg) | `edi` | `ecx` → `edi` |\n| `a` | `eax` | `eax` |\n| `b` | `ecx` | `ecx` |\n| retorno | `eax` | `eax` |\n\n```nasm\nfibo_asm:\n%ifdef WIN64\n    mov edi, ecx        ; Windows: arg en ecx → edi\n%endif\n    xor eax, eax        ; a = 0\n    mov ecx, 1          ; b = 1\n    test edi, edi\n    jz .done\n.loop:\n    dec edi\n    jz .done_b\n    add eax, ecx        ; fib = a + b\n    xchg eax, ecx       ; a = b, b = fib\n    jmp .loop\n.done_b:\n    mov eax, ecx\n.done:\n    ret\n```\n\nLlamada desde C:\n\n```c\n#include \"lib/examples/fibo.h\"\n\nint r = fibo_asm(10);  // r = 55\n```","src/content/lecciones/examples.md","da376f159b8a3931",{"html":77,"metadata":78},"\u003Ch1 id=\"ejemplos\">Ejemplos\u003C/h1>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hola-mundo-en-ensamblador\">Hola Mundo en ensamblador\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>hello_asm\u003C/code> imprime “Hello, World!” llamando a \u003Ccode>printf\u003C/code> desde\nensamblador, demostrando la integración C + ASM y la convención\nde llamada según la plataforma.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code astro-code-themes catppuccin-latte catppuccin-macchiato\" style=\"background-color:#eff1f5;--shiki-dark-bg:#24273a;color:#4c4f69;--shiki-dark:#cad3f5; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"nasm\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#1E66F5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#8AADF4;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">hello_asm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#939AB7\">:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8839EF;--shiki-dark:#C6A0F6\">    sub\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D20F39;--shiki-dark:#ED8796\"> rsp\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#4C4F69;--shiki-dark:#CAD3F5\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FE640B;--shiki-dark:#F5A97F\">40\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#7C7F93;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#939AB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">         ; shadow space (Win64) / alignment\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#4C4F69;--shiki-dark:#CAD3F5\">%\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8839EF;--shiki-dark:#C6A0F6\">ifdef\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#4C4F69;--shiki-dark:#CAD3F5\"> WIN64\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8839EF;--shiki-dark:#C6A0F6\">    lea\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D20F39;--shiki-dark:#ED8796\"> rcx\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#4C4F69;--shiki-dark:#CAD3F5\">, [\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8839EF;--shiki-dark:#C6A0F6\">rel\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#4C4F69;--shiki-dark:#CAD3F5\"> msg]  \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#7C7F93;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#939AB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">; 1er arg en rcx (Win64)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u